  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pair: ⟦{揺|ゆ}れる→揺れる：01161_yureru⟧ (intransitive, to sway). Pattern: Xを{揺|ゆ}らす (shake X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing action. {揺|ゆ}らしている = 'is shaking.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・⟦{体|からだ}→体：00784_karada⟧を{揺|ゆ}らす (sway one's body)\n・ゆりかごを{揺|ゆ}らす (rock a cradle)\n・⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧を{揺|ゆ}らす (move someone emotionally, lit. shake the heart)",
